Implement Phase 4 of the Payment Module.

Tech Stack

- Java 21
- Spring Boot
- Spring Data JPA
- Transaction Management

Project Structure

The project is organized by layer.

Create only the service layer.

Folders

service/

Do NOT create

Controllers

Repositories

Entities

DTOs

These already exist.

=========================================
OBJECTIVE
=========================================

Implement the core PaymentService.

This phase manages payment records only.

DO NOT

allocate invoices

update invoice balances

create journal entries

send emails

generate PDFs

Those belong to later phases.

